      "content": "Thanks. I'm actually seeing some really weird spikes in the salinity readings at about 4000m, though. The fluctuations don't seem to follow the expected temperature curve at all in those specific timestamps. They're almost erratic. Do you have any idea why a sensor might produce such inconsistent data in those depths, or is it more likely a natural anomaly in the water mass?",
